update content_bodies set title = 'ESHIKOTOに宿泊し名物名所網羅の福井旅！''AI恐竜動画添え’', description = '皆さまこんにちは。今回の旅は恐竜博物館に行くために計画しました。せっかくなので福井の名物をたくさん回りました。どの場所も予想を超える素晴らしさで、大充実の旅となりました。北陸新幹線が福井駅に到着したので、ぜひ皆さんも福井旅行を計画してみてください！以下は、動画に登場した場所の訪問順です。『けんぞう蕎麦』、『かつやまディノパーク』、『恐竜博物館』、『ESHIKOTO』、『永平寺』、『永平寺胡麻豆腐の里　團助』、『越前大仏』、『谷口屋』、『マリオット福井』。' where id = 'Ved0XfsMLSwVNEpGg8l3M';
update content_bodies set title = 'A Trip to Fukui with ESHIKOTO Stay and Local Attractions, Featuring AI Dinosaur Videos', description = 'Hello everyone! This trip was planned with the intention of visiting the Dinosaur Museum. We made sure to explore many local specialties in Fukui. Each location exceeded our expectations, making it a fulfilling journey. With the Hokuriku Shinkansen now reaching Fukui Station, I encourage everyone to consider planning a trip to Fukui! Below are the places we visited in the order they appeared in the video: ''Kenzou Soba'', ''Katsuyama Dino Park'', ''Dinosaur Museum'', ''ESHIKOTO'', ''Eiheiji Temple'', ''Eiheiji Sesame Tofu Village - Dansuke'', ''Echizen Great Buddha'', ''Taniguchiya'', and ''Marriott Fukui''.' where id = 'uL4S1TBfhRI315H-pDA4h';
