update content_bodies set title = '和歌山で旅育！南紀熊野ジオパークを知る', description = '和歌山県を旅して学びを得る機会があります。今回は南紀熊野ジオパークについて、楽しみながら学ぶプログラムです。大地の成り立ちを学び、大きな岩が曲がる様子を観察し、シーカヤックで海に浮かぶ奇岩に近づく体験ができます。親子で和歌山での旅育を楽しむことができる素晴らしい機会です。' where id = '8VfAdxZ_1cTXoKEz7W8eM';
update content_bodies set title = 'Travel Education in Wakayama! Discover the Nanki Kumano Geopark', description = 'Why not travel in Wakayama and gain knowledge? This time, we will learn about the Nanki Kumano Geopark in a fun way. Participants will learn about the formation of the earth, observe how large rocks bend, and get close to unique rock formations while sea kayaking. It''s a great opportunity for families to engage in travel education in Wakayama.' where id = 'SO8aUiDQlSAyFIVCXmVus';
update content_bodies set title = '串柿', description = '串柿の里として400年の歴史を持つ四郷（しごう）は、のどかな山里に位置し、紀ノ川の清流や雨引山、龍門山、高野山、大峰山を望むことができます。東谷、平、滝、広口の四つの村から成る四郷は、串柿の特産地として知られています。11月になると、串柿作りが始まり、農家の軒先や干場に柿が吊るされ、村は柿一色に染まります。この美しい風景は晩秋の風物詩として全国に知られ、多くの人々を楽しませています。また、山沿いの村からの展望は息をのむほど美しく、春から夏にかけての新緑の季節は心を癒してくれます。' where id = 'QJMSV6yuoEumPAvE14ifN';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kushigaki', description = 'Shigou, known as the home of Kushigaki (dried persimmons), has a history and tradition that dates back 400 years. Nestled in a tranquil mountain village, it offers stunning views of the Kinokawa River and the surrounding mountains, including Amabiki, Ryumon, Koyasan, and Omine. The four villages of Higashitani, Hira, Taki, and Hirokuchi collectively form Shigou, which has been recognized as a specialty area for Kushigaki. As autumn deepens in November, the production of Kushigaki begins, and the sight of persimmons hanging in rows from farmers'' eaves and drying areas transforms the village into a vibrant orange landscape. This picturesque scene has become a well-known symbol of late autumn, attracting visitors. The breathtaking views from the mountain villages, especially during the fresh green season from spring to summer, are truly captivating.' where id = 'dRHJ2h4YmuVtvTOL9W18r';
update content_bodies set title = 'ヤビツビレッジ', description = 'この動画はヤビツビレッジについて紹介しています。' where id = 'IIMpp78tcmZ44le7DmK77';
